                  "text": "Yaa 29.35-37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare ame doŋ nino abiro-ni otum, cakere i nino me aboro wot kede anyim, olamdog doŋ bino bedo waŋo mot awaŋa i wi keno lam, kede mot me kweyo cuny, an abino gamowu. Man kop ame Rwot Obaŋa okobo.”",
          "type": "text",
